<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is he... nee-chan?</font>

69
00:03:52,210 --> 00:03:54,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No walks for him for quite a while...</font>

70
00:03:54,330 --> 00:03:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The muscles of his limbs
have been severely damaged.</font>

71
00:03:56,710 --> 00:03:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a vet right, nee-chan?
Can't you somehow...?</font>

72
