<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}Intensive Care Unit 7</b></font>

77
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:32,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll soon be three hours...
Please take over.</font>

78
