<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although we're making
this kid's hair into a conductor,</font>

80
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">please don't mistake the cellular rate
