81
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

82
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:44,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for the Chakra control, handle it
as if we're threading a needle!</font>

83
00:04:45,220 --> 00:04:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood!</font>

84
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:59,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}Intensive Care Unit 6</b></font>

85
00:05:09,410 --> 00:05:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point in
you getting frustrated, right?</font>

86
00:05:13,410 --> 00:05:15,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Missions come with sacrifice...</font>

87
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You took the mental training, right?</font>

88
00:05:22,340 --> 00:05:25,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Training and actual battle
are different you know...</font>

89
00:05:25,470 --> 00:05:28,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know what missions are about...</font>

90
00:05:28,930 --> 00:05:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I thought I knew what
the Shinobi world is like.</font>

91
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:39,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I became a platoon leader
for the first time on this mission.</font>

92
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that I understood...</font>

93
00:05:42,150 --> 00:05:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not cut out to be a Shinobi.</font>

94
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:51,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Surprisingly fragile... for a man.</font>

95
00:05:52,580 --> 00:05:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time...</font>

96
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:57,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only thing I was able to do
as platoon leader...</font>

97
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:59,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was to believe in everyone.</font>

98
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was naive...</font>

99
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't have enough power...</font>

100
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:07,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all my fault!</font>

101
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:10,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you afraid of getting hurt?</font>

102
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:24,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...</font>

103
00:06:26,690 --> 00:06:29,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to be argued down
by a girl and run away?</font>

104
00:06:31,030 --> 00:06:32,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a drag...</font>

105
00:06:32,490 --> 00:06:36,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to have arguments.
I'm not a woman.</font>

106
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... But you're not a man either.</font>

107
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:42,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just a coward!</font>

108
00:06:43,590 --> 00:06:46,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you quit being Shinobi
the missions will continue.</font>

109
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone has to do it.</font>

110
00:06:49,970 --> 00:06:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your comrades will just
be dispatched again...</font>

111
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:55,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">under a different platoon leader.</font>

112
00:06:55,850 --> 00:06:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And your comrades might die there.</font>

113
00:06:59,310 --> 00:07:02,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if at that time
you were the platoon leader...</font>

114
00:07:02,730 --> 00:07:05,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your comrades might be saved
from that happening to them.</font>

115
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:10,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you reflect on this time
make use of the experience and learn</font>

116
00:07:10,570 --> 00:07:14,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you might be able to carry out missions
with more perfection.</font>

117
00:07:16,370 --> 00:07:19,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you really think your comrades
are important to you</font>

118
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before you think about running away...</font>

119
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:27,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">think about becoming more exceptional
for the sake of your comrades!</font>

120
00:07:27,590 --> 00:07:32,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what real comrades are
you coward!</font>

121
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}Intensive Care Unit 6</b></font>

122
00:07:53,570 --> 00:07:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's okay now!</font>

123
00:07:57,830 --> 00:08:00,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The antidote has stopped
the death of cells</font>

124
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:03,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">caused by the side effects of the Pills.</font>

125
00:08:04,170 --> 00:08:06,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were a big help this time, Shikaku!</font>

126
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:11,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Nara Clan's secret medicinal
preparation manual was very useful.</font>

127
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:15,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It must've been tough to
make something like that...</font>

128
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the result of day-to-day study.</font>

129
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks...</font>

130
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:21,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

131
00:08:26,940 --> 00:08:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga Neji...
His safety line has been secured.</font>

132
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there's some information...</font>

133
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:40,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hatake Kakashi and Uzumaki Naruto
have just now returned.</font>

134
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:45,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although seriously injured
it seems it's not life-threatening.</font>

135
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two, huh?</font>

136
00:08:57,470 --> 00:09:01,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...
It seems the mission is a failure.</font>

137
00:09:05,940 --> 00:09:10,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But everyone is alive!
That's the most important thing.</font>

138
00:09:15,490 --> 00:09:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time for sure...</font>

139
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll carry out the mission perfectly!</font>

140
00:09:35,930 --> 00:09:39,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... You're the chosen one.</font>

141
00:09:39,890 --> 00:09:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever... Just give me "power."</font>

142
00:09:48,850 --> 00:09:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though the form is different
it's still Orochimaru-sama before your eyes.</font>

143
00:09:53,940 --> 00:09:57,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't want to die
use more care in how you talk.</font>

144
00:10:00,570 --> 00:10:02,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What? This quality of Chakra...</font>

145
00:10:03,370 --> 00:10:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... My future is inside this kid...</font>

146
00:10:08,330 --> 00:10:11,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}Hidden Leaf Hospital</b></font>

147
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:23,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to where Orochimaru is!</font>

148
00:10:24,180 --> 00:10:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please... bring back Sasuke-kun!</font>

149
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring Sasuke back without fail!
I promise that on my life!</font>

150
00:10:43,740 --> 00:10:46,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... You were awake, huh?</font>

151
00:10:47,750 --> 00:10:49,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

152
00:10:53,420 --> 00:10:56,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going on ahead to Choji!
What about you?</font>

153
00:10:57,420 --> 00:11:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going on ahead to...
Naruto and Sasuke-kun!</font>

154
00:11:01,930 --> 00:11:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... So everyone's okay.
That's good.</font>

155
00:11:11,770 --> 00:11:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then Sasuke...</font>

156
00:11:15,860 --> 00:11:18,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... he's gone.</font>

157
00:11:33,710 --> 00:11:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}Intensive Care Unit 6</b></font>

158
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:39,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I still can't see him...?</font>

159
00:11:39,970 --> 00:11:44,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... But Tsunade-sama said that
he should regain consciousness soon.</font>

160
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness...</font>

161
00:11:49,020 --> 00:11:50,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's really a great help that</font>

162
00:11:50,890 --> 00:11:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama returned
to the Leaf Village.</font>

163
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:56,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If she hadn't right about now
Choji would be...</font>

164
00:11:59,150 --> 00:12:02,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth... Hokage-sama.</font>

165
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've come to visit?</font>

166
00:12:15,330 --> 00:12:17,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Information sure travels fast.</font>

167
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...</font>

168
00:12:26,350 --> 00:12:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

169
00:12:32,770 --> 00:12:35,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard you suffered
quite a serious injury...</font>

170
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you look well considering.</font>

171
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry... Sakura-chan...</font>

172
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you apologize?</font>

173
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:59,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Being you you probably
got reckless again, right?!</font>

174
00:13:00,050 --> 00:13:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, you look like a mummy...</font>

175
00:13:04,010 --> 00:13:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry... I...</font>

176
00:13:07,140 --> 00:13:11,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... The weather's nice today.
So open the curtains.</font>

177
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:18,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan! I...</font>

178
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll keep my promise no matter what!</font>

179
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promised on my life.
That's what I said so I...!</font>

180
00:13:27,490 --> 00:13:30,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay already, Naruto...</font>

181
00:13:31,950 --> 00:13:33,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura! He...</font>

182
00:13:33,540 --> 00:13:35,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I always...</font>

183
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">said that so... I...</font>

184
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:42,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I stick straight to what I say!</font>

185
00:13:42,460 --> 00:13:44,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my Ninja Way!</font>

186
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:05,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

187
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks Naruto...</font>

188
00:14:16,660 --> 00:14:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get right to healing this injury
and I've got to bring Sasuke back!</font>

189
00:14:24,050 --> 00:14:26,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What was that?!</font>

190
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:32,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Per... Pervy Sage?!</font>

191
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo!</font>

192
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:41,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've come today to tell you
something important.</font>

193
00:14:42,610 --> 00:14:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on
as my official disciple,</font>

194
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll train you to become
a full-fledged Shinobi in three years.</font>

195
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three years...?</font>

196
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:54,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've received some credible information
from a certain source</font>

197
00:14:54,330 --> 00:14:55,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">concerning the "Akatsuki."</font>

198
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:57,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akatsuki...</font>

199
00:14:58,710 --> 00:15:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that it will be
three or four years</font>

200
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before they come after you next.</font>

201
00:15:07,710 --> 00:15:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care about that!</font>

202
00:15:10,470 --> 00:15:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Talking about stuff that's
so far down the road...</font>

203
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:15,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have the time
to be doing slowpoke training!</font>

204
00:15:16,350 --> 00:15:17,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

205
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:20,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I don't go after
Sasuke immediately</font>

206
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:23,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he might be killed by Orochimaru!</font>

207
00:15:24,570 --> 00:15:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Immortal" doesn't mean that
the flesh is being maintained as is.</font>

208
00:15:30,490 --> 00:15:32,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before his body decays</font>

209
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a strong and new flesh will be made
into a vessel for his soul.</font>

210
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you've learned
of the true purpose</font>

211
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for Orochimaru seeking Sasuke...</font>

212
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Then that means you also knew...?</font>

213
00:15:50,090 --> 00:15:54,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was looking into
Orochimaru's Immortality Jutsu.</font>

214
00:15:54,930 --> 00:15:56,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems with that Jutsu</font>

215
00:15:56,600 --> 00:16:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he can't reincarnate into
the next body for three years.</font>

216
00:16:02,730 --> 00:16:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And unable to wait for Sasuke
he just recently reincarnated...</font>

217
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:12,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be okay for three years from now...
There is time.</font>

218
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:15,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not a lie, is it?!</font>

219
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not a lie, is it?!</font>

220
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:21,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nope...</font>

221
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

222
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:32,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forget about Sasuke...</font>

223
00:16:34,470 --> 00:16:38,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke went to Orochimaru
on his own accord.</font>

224
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what you do
he won't change.</font>

225
00:16:44,770 --> 00:16:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've seen many Shinobi so I know...</font>

226
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:50,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is the same kind
as Orochimaru.</font>

227
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:57,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're thinking about bringing him back
just forget it.</font>

228
00:16:57,280 --> 00:17:00,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's something an arrogant fool
would do!</font>

229
00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He may be nothing to you
but he's my friend!</font>

230
00:17:06,670 --> 00:17:09,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Would a friend hurt his comrade?!</font>

231
00:17:09,170 --> 00:17:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take a look at your current plight!</font>

232
00:17:13,630 --> 00:17:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...!</font>

233
00:17:21,350 --> 00:17:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? Why would you...?</font>

234
00:17:24,810 --> 00:17:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were called Sannin together...</font>

235
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't we comrades
since we were kids?!</font>

236
00:17:32,190 --> 00:17:35,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In every regard
you're a foolish guy, Jiraiya...</font>

237
00:17:35,650 --> 00:17:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You lack thought
in everything you do.</font>

238
00:17:39,490 --> 00:17:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why you didn't notice
what I was doing.</font>

239
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't you rethink it, Orochimaru?</font>

240
00:17:48,670 --> 00:17:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Absurd!</font>

241
00:17:51,170 --> 00:17:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can you be so stupid?!</font>

242
00:17:55,260 --> 00:17:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how much I wanted it...</font>

243
00:17:57,760 --> 00:18:00,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the end there was no way
he would come back.</font>

244
00:18:01,180 --> 00:18:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After the agony, all that's left was
my own powerlessness and regret.</font>

245
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want you to go through
the same thing...</font>

246
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're going to go after Sasuke
then there'll be no training.</font>

247
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:21,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get ANBU Black Ops to watch you</font>

248
00:18:21,490 --> 00:18:24,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and depending on the case
prohibit you from leaving the village.</font>

249
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not just an ordinary kid...</font>

250
00:18:29,420 --> 00:18:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You possess the Nine Tail Fox
that the Akatsuki is after!</font>

251
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:34,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is serious.
I'll just have to do that...</font>

252
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you're going to act on your own
without listening to what I say.</font>

253
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:43,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eventually you're going to have to deal</font>

254
00:18:43,890 --> 00:18:47,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with guys more troublesome
than Orochimaru.</font>

255
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up on Sasuke.</font>

256
00:18:51,690 --> 00:18:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sooner or later this was
going to happen.</font>

257
00:18:54,570 --> 00:18:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't suffer anymore!
Forget and dismiss him.</font>

258
00:18:58,950 --> 00:19:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just Jutsu or power...</font>

259
00:19:00,740 --> 00:19:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're a Shinobi develop eyes that
can make the right judgment.</font>

260
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:08,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if you're going to live
as a Shinobi become wise.</font>

261
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:10,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you remain a fool...</font>

262
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the reality is that it will be tough
living in this world.</font>

263
00:19:15,590 --> 00:19:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine.</font>

264
00:19:19,010 --> 00:19:21,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's what being wise is...</font>

265
00:19:21,930 --> 00:19:24,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'm fine being a fool for life!</font>

266
00:19:26,010 --> 00:19:27,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if by myself</font>

267
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll create even more awesome Jutsu
and save Sasuke no matter what!</font>

268
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And and
I'll even kick the Akatsuki's butt!</font>

269
00:19:50,290 --> 00:19:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If someone like you
were to do it alone...</font>

270
00:19:54,330 --> 00:19:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the best you'd be able
to come up with</font>

271
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would be some
stupid erotic Jutsu anyway.</font>

272
00:20:04,930 --> 00:20:06,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It might somehow work out</font>

273
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you are a big fool and
not an ordinary fool...</font>

274
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:12,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be prepared once
you're out of the hospital</font>

275
00:20:12,690 --> 00:20:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you big fool.</font>

276
00:20:16,020 --> 00:20:17,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you then.</font>

277
00:20:17,770 --> 00:20:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger!</font>

278
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:30,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— It's been seven years since...
— ...all the members gathered like this.</font>

279
00:20:30,790 --> 00:20:33,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since Orochimaru left
the organization.</font>

280
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Orochimaru has gotten
the Sharingan.</font>

281
00:20:37,750 --> 00:20:40,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi... Your younger brother?</font>

282
00:20:43,380 --> 00:20:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get hasty. Yeah.</font>

283
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll kill Orochimaru eventually...</font>

284
00:20:49,100 --> 00:20:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly
there are only three years left.</font>

285
00:20:51,890 --> 00:20:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can everyone accomplish
the work required of them?</font>

286
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:55,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

287
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, our goal is...</font>

288
00:20:59,020 --> 00:21:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to get everything
including the Nine Tail Fox in question!</font>

289
00:21:12,460 --> 00:21:17,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

290
